Subject: [PATCH] vkms: use local DRM string helpers for out-of-tree builds

The v5 series exports helpers from DRM core. An out-of-tree VKMS build
cannot change those exports in the installed kernel. The companion shim
provides local names used only by vkms_config_show().

--- a/vkms_config.c
+++ b/vkms_config.c
@@ -13 +13,2 @@
+#include "vkms_oot_shim.h"
 #include "vkms_config.h"
